,"answer":"3","solution_heading":"Full Solution","solution_text":"<style> *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>Correct Answer: Option C - 1991.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>The disinvestment process of Central Public Sector Enterprises (CPSEs) in India was initiated in 1991, as part of the broader economic liberalization reforms undertaken by the Government of India in response to the balance of payments crisis, aiming to reduce the government's stake in public sector enterprises and improve their efficiency.</span></p>","solution_image_1":"","solution_image_2":"","solution_video":"","difficulty_level":"0","topic":"","exam":"","section_id":"4","subject":"","concept":"","report_count":"0","set_no":"0","positive_marks":"3.00","negative_marks":"1.00","sortingparam":"0.00","question_heading":"","directive":"","deleted":"0","image_check":"0","subject_title":"","concept_title":"","topic_title":""},{"id":"30191","test_series_id":"2","test_id":"792","question_type":"1","question_ui_type":"1","question":"<style> *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>The approximate height of the India Gate is _____.</span></p>","option_1":"56 m","option_2":"42 m","option_3":"30 m","option_4":"65 m","option_5":"","option_6":"","option_7":"","option_8":"","option_9":"","option_10":"","option_image_1":"","option_image_2":"","option_image_3":"","option_image_4":"","option_image_5":"","option_image_6":"","option_image_7":"","option_image_8":"","option_image_9":"","option_image_10":"","image_link_1":"","image_link_2":"","image_link_3":"","answer":"2","solution_heading":"Full Solution","solution_text":"<style> *{overflow-wrap: break-word;} </style> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\"><span>Correct Answer: Option B - 42 m.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:12pt\">